    "question": {
      ":question/id": "c3d5ccf1-fcda-5b6d-bc36-3fcc52833245",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\n- The zeros of the function are exactly $x=n\\pi.$\n\n- The vertical asymptotes are exactly $x=2n\\pi.$\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}).$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "c4492ab9-2611-52a8-bd9d-a3e97500134d",
